<h1>Sygnal Components</h1>

<p>General-purpose code components to support your Webflow designs. All components integrate directly into the Webflow Designer with configurable properties, slots, and variants. They are published as a Webflow Component Library and installed from the <a href="https://www.sygnal.com/market">Sygnal Marketplace</a>.</p>

<p>This documentation set is the single source of truth for the library. Each component has its own <code>.hd</code> page covering purpose, properties, behavior, and troubleshooting.</p>

